Subject: [PATCH 7/8] seam: per-task capability authority at file/terminal
 effects (experimental)

agent/delegation_context.py carries a DelegationIdentity (run, task,
generation, write scope, capability profile) set by the orchestrator;
file tools, execute_code, the local environment and the terminal tool
enforce it at the actual effect. tools/delegation_contracts.py holds the
shared capability profiles. With no identity set, nothing changes.

Experimental, built against Hermes 8a3ede1b.
